      status: 'Named test-off checklist in the syllabus.', goal: 'Use the correct tube and formulation, deliver each medication separately, and preserve tube patency and the feeding plan.', refs: ['enteral', 'sps'],
      supplies: ['Verified order/MAR and formulation/interaction information', 'Correct enteral/ENFit syringe sizes and adapters', 'Appropriate water and prescribed flush volumes', 'Separately prepared medications, approved tablet crusher if appropriate, gloves and supplies for tube/stoma assessment'],
